>
>	I was playing recently, and doing very well as a Xorn, unto
>	I took a short cut and suddenly ended up human again, suronded 
>	by several tones of rock on all directions.
>
>	Can anyone help.
>
>	Yours Dave Ford.

There's no way to polymorph permanently.  The amount of time depends on
your experience level compared to the monsters experience level.

If you wind up surrounded by rock, there are many way to get out, 
including:

- Polymorph again (using rings of polymorph and polymorph control, or
     a ring of polymorph control and a wand of polymorph).
- Teleport (wand, spell, scroll, intrinsic,...)
- Level teleport (confused scroll of teleport, possibly prayer may 
      cause your god to level teleport you, ...)
- Dig (wand, pick-axe, sideways or down)

Probably more...
